
 --------------------- PROGRAM HUCKEL_TB ------------------------------
     VERSION: 2.0
 ----------------------------------------------------------------------

 Calculates the electronic structure of a crystalline material in the  
 Tight-Binding aproximation. The radial part of the atomic orbitals are
 Described  as linear combination  of Slater-Type Functions (STO).  The
 Elements of the Hamiltonian matrix follows the Huckel prescription: the
 Overlaps among the orbitals are explicitely computed.

 Unit System:

 DISTANCES: Angstrons (A)
  ENERGIES: electron volts (eV)
    FORCES: eV/Angs

 In the current version  of the program, the maximum allowed values for
 The L quantum numbers is LMAX = 2 (s, p and d)
